"description": "ICU Medical, Inc. engages in the provision of innovative medical products used in infusion therapy and critical care applications. Its product portfolio includes IV smart pumps, sets, connectors, closed system transfer devices for hazardous drugs, sterile IV solutions, cardiac monitoring systems, along with pain management and safety software technology designed to help meet clinical, safety and workflow goals. The company was founded by George A. Lopez in 1984 and is headquartered in San Clemente, CA.",
